  lines:
  - speaker: 0
    text: Someone threw this in the trash a little further away, for some unknwown
      reason.
  - speaker: 1
    text: How can one dare to get rid of such a marvel ?!
  - speaker: 0
    text: "I have to say that I don\u2019t really see the point, to be honest."
  - speaker: 1
    text: 'This is a remnant of the greatest weapons in the ancient world ! '
  - speaker: 1
    text: A metal demon carried by every soldier, spitting flames and steel on their
      enemies !
  - speaker: 0
    text: "But it\u2019s terrifying! Who would want a demon near them ?! Take it,
      I don\u2019t want to have it for another second !"
  - speaker: 1
    text: "You all are too closed to the past and our history. *Sigh*... there was
      a time when I wasn\u2019t the only one interested in it..."
